00:24:57.179 --> 00:24:58.379
Eu sou bonito?

00:25:00.859 --> 00:25:02.580
Claro que sim!

00:25:02.699 --> 00:25:04.939
Em todo o Reino Lingyou,

00:25:05.179 --> 00:25:06.219
